{%- comment -%}
  Paste this into the "Quadrant" tab of the bus-grabo plugin's Edit Markup
  screen (separate from the "Full" tab's template.liquid). Compact version
  for small Mashup panes: each board gets one row with its icon on the left
  (framing the two departure lines like a small departure board) + line/time
  for ETD and Nästa, plus a one-line "Senaste position" (last seen) row - a
  real nearest bus stop name + timestamp, shown even for a sighting from
  that line running a different direction or route variant, always
  populated once any GPS sighting has ever been recorded (see fetch.mjs's
  nearestStopName() and buildLastSeen()). No separate map image here (a
  Quadrant pane is too narrow for the 480px-wide position map to be legible
  - that stays on the Full view only).

  Icon direction: see template.liquid's comment - icons are drawn nose-first
  towards the right, so placed at the left edge they read as driving into
  the departure lines next to them.

  Same rules as template.liquid: every text line uses "label" so size/font
  stays identical and pixelated throughout; each icon <img> is a single LONE
  <img>, sitting inside its own table cell (plain <table>/<td>, not TRMNL's
  styled table component) - a bare <div class="layout layout--row"> wrapper
  let the surrounding layout stretch an icon into a tall narrow sliver
  instead of its real landscape shape on a real device, table cells don't
  have that problem.
{%- endcomment -%}

<div class="layout layout--col gap--small">

  <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;">
    <tr>
      <td rowspan="2" style="width: 48px; border: none; padding: 0 6px 0 0; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle;">
        <img class="image image--contain image-dither" src="{{ mjorn_to_grabo.icon_url }}" width="44" height="22" style="width: 44px; height: 22px;">
      </td>
      <td colspan="2" style="border: none; padding: 0; text-align: left;"><div class="label">MJÖRN &gt; GRÅBO</div></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      {% if mjorn_to_grabo.has_departure %}
      <td style="border: 1px solid #000; padding: 1px 6px; text-align: center;"><div class="label">{{ mjorn_to_grabo.estimated_time }}{% if mjorn_to_grabo.delay_minutes > 0 %} (+{{ mjorn_to_grabo.delay_minutes }}){% endif %}</div></td>
      {% if mjorn_to_grabo.next_departure_time %}
      <td style="border: 1px solid #000; padding: 1px 6px; text-align: center;"><div class="label">{{ mjorn_to_grabo.next_departure_time }}</div></td>
      {% else %}
      <td style="border: none;"></td>
      {% endif %}
      {% else %}
      <td colspan="2" style="border: none; padding: 1px 6px; text-align: center;"><div class="label">Ingen avgång</div></td>
      {% endif %}
    </tr>
  </table>
  <div class="label">Senaste position: {{ mjorn_to_grabo.last_seen.location_text }} ({{ mjorn_to_grabo.last_seen.seen_at_display }})</div>

  <div class="divider"></div>

  <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;">
    <tr>
      <td rowspan="2" style="width: 48px; border: none; padding: 0 6px 0 0; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle;">
        <img class="image image--contain image-dither" src="{{ grabo_to_goteborg.icon_url }}" width="44" height="22" style="width: 44px; height: 22px;">
      </td>
      <td colspan="2" style="border: none; padding: 0; text-align: left;"><div class="label">GRÅBO &gt; GÖTEBORG</div></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      {% if grabo_to_goteborg.has_departure %}
      <td style="border: 1px solid #000; padding: 1px 6px; text-align: center;"><div class="label">{{ grabo_to_goteborg.estimated_time }}{% if grabo_to_goteborg.delay_minutes > 0 %} (+{{ grabo_to_goteborg.delay_minutes }}){% endif %}</div></td>
      {% if grabo_to_goteborg.next_departure_time %}
      <td style="border: 1px solid #000; padding: 1px 6px; text-align: center;"><div class="label">{{ grabo_to_goteborg.next_departure_time }}</div></td>
      {% else %}
      <td style="border: none;"></td>
      {% endif %}
      {% else %}
      <td colspan="2" style="border: none; padding: 1px 6px; text-align: center;"><div class="label">Ingen avgång</div></td>
      {% endif %}
    </tr>
  </table>
  <div class="label">Senaste position: {{ grabo_to_goteborg.last_seen.location_text }} ({{ grabo_to_goteborg.last_seen.seen_at_display }})</div>

</div>

<div class="title_bar">
  <span class="title">Bussar</span>
  <span class="instance">{{ updated_display }}</span>
</div>
